# ThriftGram — AI Change Log

This log is the institutional memory of the codebase. Every AI session that writes code must add an entry. No exceptions.

Format:
```
[YYYY-MM-DD] <one-line summary of the work>
Files: <comma-separated list of files changed>
Decisions: <bullet list of non-obvious decisions made — why, not what>
```

